{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"提多書","commonName":"提多書","title":"提多書","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"3869f5bc4a8365b940b2a2341662aa5189de376890cda87a9ad345a80d108be5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["專心行善"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要提醒眾人順服執政掌權者，要服從，隨時準備做各種善事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["不要毀謗，不要爭吵，要謙和、恭敬地對待每一個人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["從前我們也愚蠢、悖逆、易受迷惑，受各種私慾和享樂驅使，心裡充滿惡念和嫉妒，令人憎惡，也彼此憎恨。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["但我們的救主上帝向人彰顯了祂的恩慈和仁愛，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["藉著重生之洗和聖靈的更新拯救了我們，這並非因為我們有義行，而是因為祂的憐憫。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["上帝藉著我們的救主耶穌基督把聖靈豐豐富富地澆灌在我們身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["這樣，我們既然靠著祂的恩典被稱為義人，就可以成為後嗣，有永生的盼望。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["以上這些話是可信的，希望你認真強調，使信上帝的人專心行善。這都是造福眾人的美事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["要避免愚昧的爭論、有關家譜的辯駁和律法上的爭執，因為這些毫無益處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["對於製造分裂的人，警告過一兩次後，要和他斷絕來往。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因為你知道這種人已經背道犯罪，自定己罪。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["信末的囑咐與問候"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我會派亞提馬或者推基古去見你。到時候，你要盡快到尼哥波立來見我，因為我決定在那裡過冬。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你要為西納律師和亞波羅送行，盡力幫助他們，讓他們路上一無所缺。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我們的弟兄姊妹也要學習行善，供應有急需的人，免得毫無建樹。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["這裡的弟兄姊妹都問候你，也請你問候那些因信仰而愛我們的人。 願恩典常與你們眾人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/PHM/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/TIT/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}